---
// Author introduction component for homepage
---

<section class="author-intro" aria-labelledby="author-title">
  <div class="author-content">
    <div class="author-avatar">
      <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect width="64" height="64" rx="32" fill="var(--color-accent)"/>
        <rect x="16" y="20" width="32" height="4" rx="2" fill="white"/>
        <rect x="20" y="28" width="24" height="4" rx="2" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.8)"/>
        <rect x="16" y="36" width="32" height="4" rx="2" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.6)"/>
        <circle cx="32" cy="48" r="6" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.9)"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    
    <div class="author-info">
      <h1 id="author-title" class="author-name">안녕하세요</h1>
      <p class="author-description">
        이 블로그는 개인적인 글쓰기와 생각 정리를 위한 공간입니다. 
        개발, 독서, 일상의 작은 통찰들을 기록합니다.
      </p>
      <p class="author-note">
        <strong>참고:</strong> 이 소개글은 편집 가능한 플레이스홀더입니다. 
        실제 소개 내용으로 수정해주세요.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .author-intro {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }
  
  .author-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: var(--prose-max-width);
  }
  
  .author-avatar {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  
  .author-info {
    flex: 1;
  }
  
  .author-name {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }
  
  .author-description {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  
  .author-note {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  /* Mobile responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .author-intro {
      padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
    }
    
    .author-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
    
    .author-name {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
    
    .author-description {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .author-content {
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    
    .author-name {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>